    <string name="modpack_caution_body">Modpacks are built for desktop Forge / Fabric / NeoForge.\nSome of them will not run in this launcher, and some mods inside them will not work.\nThe launcher can point at the mod that crashed and let you turn mods on and off, but the developer does not take issues about modpack compatibility.\n\nThe active community is the better place to look for a fix.</string>
