    <string name="renderer_desc_zink">Vulkan to OpenGL. The most compatible on modern GPUs; recommended for 1.17+. Internally it falls back on its own: Vulkan Zink → Freedreno/Panfrost (per vendor) → GL4ES.</string>
    <string name="renderer_desc_gl4es">OpenGL to GLES2. For old versions (1.12 and below) and devices Zink will not run on.</string>
    <string name="renderer_desc_mobileglues">OpenGL to GLES 3.2. Best for shaders and modern versions.</string>
    <string name="renderer_desc_krypton">An advanced GL4ES-based wrapper (NG-GL4ES). Shaders and broad version coverage; built in.</string>
